<title>USA: Herbalife to buy back one mln shares.</title>
<headline>Herbalife to buy back one mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Herbalife International Inc said it authorized an extension of its stock repurchase program, permitting it to buy back a total of one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>To date, the company has repurchased 360,000 shares for about $4 million.</p>
<p>Herbalife said it would repurchase the shares from time to time in the public market. It said the duration of the plan and the timing of the repurchases will be determined by overall financial considerations, market conditions and the needs of the company.</p>
</text>
